title: Staging one change of a file leaves the others unstaged, and the card tells the two apart (the staged one dashed, the other solid)
folders: git-changes
limit: 60
forbid-log: WARN.*script
forbid-log: script: ignoring
expect-log: script: Part\(

wait 3500
left changes
goto src/steps.rs
wait 1500
zoom 0.6
wait 800
mark a-three-unstaged
wait 450
part stage src/steps.rs 39
wait 1500
mark b-one-staged
wait 450
part stage src/steps.rs 6
wait 1500
mark c-two-staged
wait 450
git unstage src/steps.rs
wait 1500
mark d-none-staged
wait 450
quit
